type: software
title: "Molten: A Native Rust + Metal Inference Engine for LFM2.5 on Apple Silicon"
abstract: >-
  Molten is a native Rust + Metal inference engine for LiquidAI LFM2.5-24B-A2B (MLX 4-bit) on Apple M5-series
  Macs, written by AI coding agents in a recursive self-improvement loop.
